{"id": "99210013", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות בטבלה עם קבוע c – מציאת c, תוחלת ושונות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>למשתנה המקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> פונקציית ההסתברות הבאה, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span> קבוע:</p><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:auto\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(k\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X=k)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:4}}c\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:5}}c\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:6}}c\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:7}}c\\)</td></tr></table></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> סכום ההסתברויות הוא 1; התוחלת לפי ההגדרה; השונות לפי \\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[X^2]-\\mathbb{E}[X]^2\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הקבוע c</b><br>סכום כל ההסתברויות הוא 1:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ ({{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}+{{CT:6}}+{{CT:7}})c=1\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad c={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התוחלת</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]=\\sum_k k\\,\\mathbb{P}(X=k)=\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\cdot{{CT:9}}+\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)\\cdot{{CT:10}}+\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\cdot{{CT:11}}+\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)\\cdot{{CT:12}}={{CT:13}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השונות</b><br>קודם המומנט השני:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X^2]=\\sum_k k^2\\,\\mathbb{P}(X=k)={{CT:14}}\\cdot{{CT:9}}+{{CT:15}}\\cdot{{CT:10}}+{{CT:16}}\\cdot{{CT:11}}+{{CT:17}}\\cdot{{CT:12}}={{CT:18}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Var}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[X^2]-\\mathbb{E}[X]^2={{CT:18}}-\\left({{CT:13}}\\right)^2={{CT:19}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "cc", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "ex", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremod